            <title>[LU-19696] EFA: unable to delete all efa interfaces at once.</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19696</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We can delete EFA interfaces one by one using cmd&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
lnetctl net del --net efa --&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; if_name
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But we cannot delete all since the following cmd takes no effect&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
lnetctl net del --net efa 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
